summary:
  An open of the single file does not note the place it sent the reader to.

history:
  The end can come before the reader was ever seen playing: the file is
  opened, the reader is sent to the park and runs into the unfinished end
  at once. The place it was sent to is all that is known of it then, and
  without it the end reads as a buffer played out.

target:
  package/contents/ui/TimeshiftEngine.qml

find:
          _heardPosMs = shiftPosMs;

replace:
          _heardPosMs = -1;

expect:
  Killed by tst_timeshiftengine::test_an_end_before_the_reader_was_seen_reopens_where_it_was_sent.
  Line-neutral.
